p:6pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company&#8217;s facilities in Pottsville, PA (&#8220;PV&#8221;) and Guangzhou, China (&#8220;GZ&#8221;) have a tolling arrangement whereby certain surface protection films are manufactured in GZ for a fee with raw materials supplied from PV that are then shipped by GZ directly to customers principally in the Asian market but paid by customers directly to PV.</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">  </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Amounts associated with this intercompany tolling arrangement are reported in the table above as export sales from the U.S. to Asia, and include net sales of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-231" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="f-1515">26.1</ix:nonFraction> million in 2025, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-232" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="f-1516">26.9</ix:nonFraction> million in 2024 and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-233" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Revenues" scale="6" id="f-1517">15.9</ix:nonFraction> million in 2023. </span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">61</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:42.75pt;width:100%"><div><span><br/></span></div></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEntityWideInformationRevenueFromExternalCustomersByProductsAndServicesTextBlock" id="f-1518" escape="true"><ix:continuation id="f-1310-6"><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-