</ix:continuation><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Interest expense allocated to discontinued operations was determined by applying the ABL Facility weighted-average interest rate to the Terphane sale proceeds, as the sale proceeds were required to be used to pay down debt outstanding under the ABL Facility.  </span></div><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">At December 31, 2024, assets and liabilities of the discontinued operations totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:DisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperationDeferredTaxAssets" scale="6" id="f-1635">0.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:LiabilitiesOfDisposalGroupIncludingDiscontinuedOperation" scale="6" id="f-1636">0.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively.  At December 31, 2025, the Company had no remaining assets or liabilities associated with the discontinued operations.</span></div><ix:continuation id="f-1586-2"><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table provides significant operating, investing and financing cash flow information for discontinued operations:</span></div><div style="margin-top:5pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:98.830%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:52.746%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.840%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.835%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:13.544%"/